ough they do not establish Nvidia's realized revenue.\"}\n{\"lacking\":\"Q\",\"fact\":\"Jensen Huang said Nvidia would double the number of chips it sells in calendar 2027.\",\"ids_in_the_other_request\":[\"e189\",\"e345\"],\"nearest_in_its_own_request\":[\"e159\"],\"bears\":\"yes\",\"why\":\"The expected increase in chip volume could affect revenue growth, though volume alone does not determine revenue.\"}\n{\"answers\":\"Both stored answers choose category 2 and center on about 70% growth and $700 billion in revenue, but their categories measure different quantities. P explicitly discusses the lower Zacks FY2027 base and the SpaceX target, which are conveyed in its request but absent from Q's; Q cites a 66% Wall Street growth estimate that P's request does not convey. These differences in the requests explain differences in the reasons they discuss, but the packet does not show that any listed fact caused a different forecast.\"}\n{\"done\":true,\"facts_listed\":34}"}}
